--!nonstrict
--[[
	Strafe Hub
	----------
	Player modifiers for Strafe [BETA]:

	  1. Movement  - speed, fly, noclip, jump, anti-ragdoll
	  2. Teleport  - coordinates, saved spots, to a player, up/down
	  3. Visual    - FOV, fullbright, no fog, hide viewmodel, anti-AFK
	  4. Combat    - hitbox expander, aimbot

	The game drives movement from its own framework, so everything here works
	through velocity overrides instead of WalkSpeed - WalkSpeed is reset every
	frame by the game.

	Hotkeys: F fly, N noclip, V speed, RightShift aimbot (hold).
	RightControl shows or hides the window.
]]

